From f82bac808e2c9f367d42f2068889f23035912393 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:40:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] LV8: Dreamcast pack reader (dc/src/breachdisc.c, host
 test) and the GBA memreport levels rows

dc/src/breachdisc.c reads a pack from /cd/BREACH.BIN through the KOS file calls and the core reader (behind
DOOMO_BREACH_BIN, make -C dc BREACH=1); dc/tests/breachdisc_host.sh is the host test (check-breachdisc).
gba/tools/memreport.py prints the levels' ROM (map tables) and EWRAM / IWRAM rows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xd63cxE5CiE8LkNQXc6Au3
